@startuml payment-lifecycle
title Initial Payment Lifecycle

[*] --> CREATED : createPayment
CREATED --> PROCESSING : startProcessing
PROCESSING --> SUCCEEDED : recordSuccess
PROCESSING --> FAILED : recordFailure
SUCCEEDED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]

note right of CREATED
  Persisted and returned by POST.
  No external payment has occurred.
end note

note bottom of SUCCEEDED
  SUCCEEDED and FAILED are terminal
  for the current lifecycle.
end note
@enduml
